=1 2 7
+    dxserial.c
=1 10 3
+    This module implements the serial boot driver for the DECstation 5000.
+    The serial lines of the 5000/200 are lines of the DZ (DC7085)
+    multiplexer, the lines of the 5000/1xx and the 5000/240 channels of
+    their two SCCs (Z85C30, decscc.h): serial(0) is line 2, the
+    communications port, and serial(1) is line 3, the console port.  The
+    firmware uses serial(1) as its console.
+
+    The DZ has one receiver silo for its four lines.  Each character read
+    from the silo carries its line number, and the driver keeps the
+    characters received on each line in a buffer of the line until they
+    are read.  The receiver of an SCC channel holds three characters: the
+    driver empties the receivers of the serial ports into the buffers of
+    their lines in the same way.
=1 14 15
+#include "decscc.h"
=1 30 70
+#define SP_BASE(Fid) ULONG SP; \
